<!--
  Three blades and a hub, inside the same 24dp gauge ring the other metric glyphs use.

  Drawn as one blade repeated in three rotated groups rather than three hand-transformed paths:
  VectorDrawable has no <use>, and the alternative is rotating a dozen Bezier control points by
  hand, where a single wrong digit produces a shape that still renders and is silently lopsided.
-->
